  "description": "**Available immediately**Unfurnished**Two double bedroom mid terrace bungalow with two bathroom extending to approx.58 sqm, lovely rear garden, one car space.  The Burgage is a small leafy development situated off Dalkey Avenue just minutes walk from the town.  DART, Bus and Aircoach services are all nearby.  Accommodation in brief: entrance porch, livingroom with open fireplace, separate kitchen with electric cooker, under counter fridge and freezer units, washing machine and microwave.  Double bedroom with fitted wardrobes, en-suite shower off, patio door leading to garden.  Second double bedroom which also has a patio door to the garden.  Main bathroom with electric shower over bath, w.h.b. and w.c, hot press.  OUTSIDE: there is a lovely garden laid out in grass with patio area, views across out to Dalkey, plastic storage box.  **PROFESSIONALLY MANAGED BY SHERRY FITZGERALD LETTINGS**",
